    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST FULL GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This prologue offers the chance to experience the combat of the complete game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GUARDIANS OF GAIA: Complete Version</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/b7b4999f49e8efc21f4ce243eae91a07.poster.avif?t=1697644268\" width=624 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/b7b4999f49e8efc21f4ce243eae91a07.webm?t=1697644268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/b7b4999f49e8efc21f4ce243eae91a07.mp4?t=1697644268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your Guardian!</strong></h2></li></ul>Choose from a diverse set of characters with unique abilities. Exchange your spoils from battle to unlock new skills and master new weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/d3486e9ff2b12c4a5f73b5d42732c565.avif?t=1697644268\" width=620 height=232 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advance your combat!</strong></h2></li></ul>Discover different weapon styles, character traits and the use of Gaia elements. Switch weapons mid-game to alter the course of the battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/c95f0c2ba3286f8bc3c78242d31058c7.poster.avif?t=1697644268\" width=624 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/c95f0c2ba3286f8bc3c78242d31058c7.webm?t=1697644268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/c95f0c2ba3286f8bc3c78242d31058c7.mp4?t=1697644268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Arena!</strong></h2></li></ul>Explore how to use the environment to gain tactical advantage. Each Arena features multiple routes, choke points and unlockable shortcuts. Use team work and mobility to control the arena.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/12b01e2bcc8ce2af5776c8fcd2d20437.avif?t=1697644268\" width=620 height=522 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become Guardian. Become Gaia.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "This prologue offers the chance to experience the combat of the complete game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GUARDIANS OF GAIA: Complete Version</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/b7b4999f49e8efc21f4ce243eae91a07.poster.avif?t=1697644268\" width=624 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/b7b4999f49e8efc21f4ce243eae91a07.webm?t=1697644268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/b7b4999f49e8efc21f4ce243eae91a07.mp4?t=1697644268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your Guardian!</strong></h2></li></ul>Choose from a diverse set of characters with unique abilities. Exchange your spoils from battle to unlock new skills and master new weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/d3486e9ff2b12c4a5f73b5d42732c565.avif?t=1697644268\" width=620 height=232 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advance your combat!</strong></h2></li></ul>Discover different weapon styles, character traits and the use of Gaia elements. Switch weapons mid-game to alter the course of the battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/c95f0c2ba3286f8bc3c78242d31058c7.poster.avif?t=1697644268\" width=624 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/c95f0c2ba3286f8bc3c78242d31058c7.webm?t=1697644268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/c95f0c2ba3286f8bc3c78242d31058c7.mp4?t=1697644268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Arena!</strong></h2></li></ul>Explore how to use the environment to gain tactical advantage. Each Arena features multiple routes, choke points and unlockable shortcuts. Use team work and mobility to control the arena.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590720/extras/12b01e2bcc8ce2af5776c8fcd2d20437.avif?t=1697644268\" width=620 height=522 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become Guardian. Become Gaia.</strong></h2>",
